# Large binaries — all installer types are allowed in public/downloads/
# so Vercel serves them directly. GitHub's per-file cap is 100 MB.
# When a build gets larger than that, migrate to GitHub Releases via
# .github/workflows/release.yml.
public/downloads/*.zip
